    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fight is coming to your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After boxing with you in VR with ARVIS Punch, and ARVIS Punch 2, our fighters are waiting to reach a bigger audience by removing the need of a headset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience a new and dynamic fight experience with our third-person perspective, and brand new animations that really PUNCH.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills with all of our classic VR fighters like Mariano, or even Ultratumba; and get ready to face new challengers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your fighter and opponent carefully, as their speed, strength or reflexes can be the difference between a nice fight and a straight Knock Out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still finding our fighters too weak? Jump into multiplayer mode, where you will be able to prove your worth online and locally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So don't waste any time, get into ARVIS Knock Out! Select your fighter, hit the ring, and get that Knock Out!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fight is coming to your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After boxing with you in VR with ARVIS Punch, and ARVIS Punch 2, our fighters are waiting to reach a bigger audience by removing the need of a headset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience a new and dynamic fight experience with our third-person perspective, and brand new animations that really PUNCH.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills with all of our classic VR fighters like Mariano, or even Ultratumba; and get ready to face new challengers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your fighter and opponent carefully, as their speed, strength or reflexes can be the difference between a nice fight and a straight Knock Out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still finding our fighters too weak? Jump into multiplayer mode, where you will be able to prove your worth online and locally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So don't waste any time, get into ARVIS Knock Out! Select your fighter, hit the ring, and get that Knock Out!</p>",
    "short_description": "Fight our characters and throw punches like never before with this third-person boxing game. Defeat all of our fighters, and take the fight further with online and local multiplayer.",
